            doc/scripts/ROILinearFit
            doc/scripts/StarSpikeProtectionMask
            doc/scripts/SubframeQualityReview
            doc/scripts/TGScriptSkeleton
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               New script: Astro Bucket List 0.8.0. Organize imaging targets by constellation and month, exchange Stellarium object lists, retrieve catalog information, and track imaging status and dates. Includes editable object details, selective export, and integrated finder-chart and DSS survey tabs. Finder charts support configured local star catalogs; oversized DSS targets automatically use the maximum survey field. PiDoc documentation is included.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
